``` IX-01 | Bucket Replication Lag Between Peers
    Interpretation and RCA: Splunk Administrator Field Manual (Gaurav Malik),
    entry IX-01. https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0HRXCT384

    Run on: SH for link errors, CM for the streaming backlog.
    Query: Streaming backlog per target (CM)
    If this returns nothing, run probes/IX-01-probe.spl,
    probes/IX-01-probe-rest.spl to confirm the data it reads exists here.
```
| rest splunk_server=local /services/cluster/master/fixup level=streaming
| rename title as bucket_id, "latest.reason" as latest_reason
| eval index=mvindex(split(bucket_id,"~"),0)
| stats count as streaming_fixups values(latest_reason) as reasons by index
| sort - streaming_fixups
